Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,SYUUUUUUUUUUUUU
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Our analysis shows your chances of\Nescape are zero percent and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,sharply in other words you kids\Nare finished well put crump it's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,only a matter of time before the\Nfive of us are set free from this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,virtual prison remember when one of\Nus defeats you we'll claim control
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.71,0:01:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,of your body leaving your mind\Ntrapped here forever these crooks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.03,0:01:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't changed a bit. Let's start\Nthis party. You five stiffs are going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.49,0:01:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,down who's going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.93,0:01:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,down as you can
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,see before the virtual dueling begins
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.43,0:01:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,we plan to separate all of you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.23,0:01:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,say
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,your profits
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.05,0:01:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,are plummeting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.85,0:02:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did my friends go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.17,0:02:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll soon find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.43,0:02:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.71,0:02:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Moguwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.01,0:02:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm in Kansas anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.61,0:02:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.59,0:02:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.50,0:03:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Can anybody hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.57,0:03:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yo, Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.31,0:03:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak to me, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where's Serenity?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.53,0:03:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.37,0:03:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been in better\Nmoods. And you? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.63,0:03:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourselves at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.23,0:03:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I have them all right where I want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one isolated in my virtual world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.17,0:03:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll be watching from the front row\Nas my associates take care of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.05,0:03:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who should be the first to suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Which way should we go, Seto?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.27,0:03:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.75,0:04:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Who better to destroy first\Nthan the infamous Yugi Moto?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.35,0:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.31,0:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be nothing but\Nprogram data digitally
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,trapped forever in a world that I created.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.99,0:04:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All this stuff looks pretty real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.25,0:04:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that\Neverything here is virtual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd better get used to this place because\NI'm going to make sure you never leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with the\Nphrase, it's time to duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is the last time\Nyou're ever going to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you look as though you\Ndon't recognize me, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've gone and hurt my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm Gansley,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.09,0:04:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,former Vice President of\NBusiness Strategy at Kyber
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Corp and a proud founding\Nmember of the Big Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.71,0:04:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now, I've taken the\Nform of the Deep Sea Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.97,0:04:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Big deal, Gansley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.43,0:04:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that behind your virtual disguise\Nis nothing but a feeble old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.53,0:05:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't stand a chance in a duel\Nagainst me if your life depended on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say my life, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I defeat you, I'll finally\Nhave a life again. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten the\Nrules of our competition already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.35,0:05:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If you win, which you\Nwon't, you're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.79,0:05:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I win, I get to return\Nto the real world in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to be young again, but I\Nwill have to change that haircut of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure your friends will be the\Nperfect fit for the rest of the Big Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.81,0:05:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,this must stop our friends\Nare in great danger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah because if they lose\Nthey'll be stuck here so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to defeat the big\Nfive at their own twisted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,game that's right and\Nit starts here and Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Gansly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your partners won't succeed\Nin trapping my friends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's if you can keep\Nup with the new rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try me. Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.05,0:06:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember my demonstration of our\Npatented Deckmaster system of dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It begins with each of\Nus picking a monster to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,serve as our Deckmaster for\Nthe duration of the duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.81,0:06:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I've already taken\Nthe form of a monster, lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I will serve as both the\Nduelist and the deckmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.45,0:06:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time for you to build\Nyour virtual deck. With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,With these.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your cards aren't valid in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so you'll have to build a new\Ndeck from our card database.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.65,0:06:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,When you see a card you\Ndesire, simply touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:07:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose wisely, for once you\Nmake contact with a card image,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it's yours for the\Nentire length of the duel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, don't let any\Ngems slip by. Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,let's begin this duel\NHow quickly we forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You still have to choose your Deckmaster
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Each monster card has its own special\NDeckmaster ability under our new system Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,of course, I won't tell you\Nwhat those abilities are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to figure\Nthat out for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What card should I choose\Nto be my deckmaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Without knowing all the new\Nrules, it's hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.03,0:07:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my dark magician\Nhas never let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Karibo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't choose him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, the rules state once a deckmaster\Nis chosen, it cannot be changed. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't choose you, but now\Nwe must win this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.57,0:08:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Coribo is now my deckmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.79,0:08:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, I've chosen Deep Sea Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.69,0:08:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He's powerful and ruthless like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.01,0:08:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But enough chatting, let's\Nget down to business!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll go first if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.73,0:08:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon a monster\Nfacedown in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.71,0:08:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.81,0:08:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What fun would it be if I wiped\Nout everything you own so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see if this\Nslacker takes my bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your move,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.29,0:08:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but realize it's only a matter of time\Nbefore I eliminate all your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.91,0:08:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you haven't the business skills necessary\Nto wheel and deal with a mogul like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Gansley, Duel Monsters is\Nabout honor, trust, and respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.83,0:09:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,not about business\Nskills and making deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So save your corporate speeches for\Nthe boardroom and stop wasting my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.37,0:09:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why worry about time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.53,0:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have nothing but time as you\Nspend all of eternity trapped right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your move, Yugi, so I can seal this\Nduel and escape from this cyber world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.53,0:09:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Obnoxious Celtic Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.59,0:09:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my guardian,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.61,0:09:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,time to slay his face-down beast\Nwith Celtic Blade Slash Attacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.85,0:10:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you thanking me for\Ndestroying your monster, Gansly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.31,0:10:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The card you destroyed\Nwas a Shining reb. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's sent to the graveyard, its\Nattacker must throw out one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.17,0:10:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have plenty of other cards left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.15,0:10:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not my monster's\Nonly special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.33,0:10:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It also allows me to summon\Nanother Ashina Grey to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.89,0:10:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I can reshuffle my deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Such poor business planning\Non your part, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Had you done the appropriate research,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.15,0:10:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you could have avoided\Nthis embarrassing loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, how cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this place isn't so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.73,0:10:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The scenery is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.73,0:10:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The breeze is nice, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:10:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's cold! Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If this place is some kind of virtual\Nillusion, how can I feel anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.45,0:11:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get this place at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.15,0:11:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to be here alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.43,0:11:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.79,0:11:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.65,0:11:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing I remember was putting a\Nscare into those big five sleazeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm stranded in some weird castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, you monkey suit\Nwearing pencil pushers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.51,0:11:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,show yourself so I can\Nreadjust your uptown attitudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you weasels are watching,\Nso come on out and duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.25,0:11:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of your bald heads and\Noutdated neckties, you old freaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.01,0:11:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.03,0:11:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't have all day to\Nplay hide-and-seek either,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's get this over with\Nso I can get on with my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.19,0:11:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.73,0:12:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that,\Nyou oversized tin can,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.99,0:12:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'll turn you into scrap metal so\Nfast your head'll spin! You got that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.09,0:12:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Serenity! Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You in here somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.69,0:12:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming to get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.01,0:12:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.29,0:12:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This virtual hallway could go on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.43,0:12:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity's gotta be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.35,0:12:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but where? I don't know. Somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.01,0:12:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing must go on for miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.11,0:12:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, but I'm\Nnot stopping till I find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.87,0:12:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You in or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.99,0:12:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.49,0:12:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto, I know the Big Five want\Nto use us to escape from this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but what's the deal with that Noah kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.27,0:12:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, who is he, and what's\Nhe getting out of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.41,0:12:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Seto, did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:12:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just wondering who Noah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.83,0:13:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I heard your question, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.25,0:13:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had to guess, I'd\Nsay he wants what's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like everyone else, he\Nwants to be as powerful as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What puzzles me the most is\Nhow he created this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that little punk\Nbuilt a virtual universe on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Big Five helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Those old fools couldn't pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.27,0:13:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Granted, it's only a copy of the\Nvirtual technology that I invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But someone else is\Ninvolved, and I'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.17,0:13:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to lose your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eperia is just the monster\NI needed to close this deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon I'll be free again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.13,0:13:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Yugi, I'm a businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the world of business,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:14:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,there are three secrets to success that\Nare guaranteed to crush the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So listen closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.53,0:14:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The first is build a powerful\Nworkforce, so come forth, Ipheria!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets me draw another card\Nto increase my dueling options.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll change Ishinagre to attack\Nmode, thus building up my workforce.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.93,0:14:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The second secret of success\Nis quite a simple one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Know your own resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,By changing Ashina Grey\Nfrom defense to attack mode,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.53,0:14:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I triggered its special ability forcing\Nyou to discard one card from your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.97,0:14:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you you couldn't\Nkeep up with the big wigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, for the last and most important\Nsecret of success in the business world,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.45,0:14:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,always keep your competition guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.21,0:14:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And I assure you, you have no idea of\Nthe horrors I have in store for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.65,0:15:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna rescue Serenity,\Nwe need a new plan. Plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.25,0:15:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious this thing\Nwas built to go on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It has no end. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.59,0:15:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So we won't find any way out because\Nthis virtual hallway doesn't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, try having a little\Nbit of faith, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.05,0:15:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You got any bright ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If there are no exits in this place,\Nthen all we got to do is make one. We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,smash through the wall dude good luck\Nthese aren't even real walls just some
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,computerized images that are designed to\Nlook like real walls you see look if you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can touch them, then they're real enough\Nto break down. Break down with what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If that axe is just an illusion,\Nhow can he be holding it? Batter up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.19,0:16:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a virtual Grand Canyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.27,0:16:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.07,0:16:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And could it be any hotter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.49,0:16:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay calm and back up slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! Someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Seto, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.59,0:17:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.95,0:17:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably an emergency exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, stop right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.79,0:17:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.85,0:17:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the orphanage we grew up in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew it was still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.63,0:17:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a trick, Moguba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A cheap virtual illusion\Nlike everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.31,0:17:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But how did Noah find\Nout we once lived here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We may as well close the\Nbook on this duel, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my wise investments,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I predict a major growth in power for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:18:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,while you sink deeper into debt thanks\Nto your pathetic deckmaster, Karibo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it appears your\Nlittle furball has an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad he can't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew what Kaiba\Nwas trying to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He may know something about these new\NDeckmaster dueling rules that I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.29,0:18:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And right now I could use\Nall the advice I could get.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.25,0:18:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up yet? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.97,0:18:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.01,0:18:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I play Polymerization!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.83,0:18:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fusing together Berphomet and\NGazelle, the king of mythical beasts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.29,0:18:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,To form Chimera, the\Nflying mythical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate my\NMagic Card Quick Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Allowing my Chimera to\Nattack your Iperia now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.93,0:18:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,An interesting move, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.97,0:18:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But a very poor business decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.69,0:19:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's time for\Nyou to pay the price!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself, Gansley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, I've taken the\Nform of Deep Sea Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my Deckmaster ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.85,0:19:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sacrifice my two\Nmonsters to create this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.87,0:19:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Reflector Pole, bounce\Nhis attack right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your life points\Nare starting to collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And before long, you'll be completely\Ndrained of everything you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't put me out\Nof business yet, Gensley.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.03,0:19:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time, Yugi. Soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,my colleagues and I will\Ndestroy you and your
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.65,0:19:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,friends in the greatest\Ncorporate takeover in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.79,0:19:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of your friends, I wonder how\Nthey're holding up in their new environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.79,0:19:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.93,0:20:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools must be suffering\Neven greater losses than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.65,0:20:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And you can't save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.67,0:20:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to end this and find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.89,0:20:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack to your\Nsmall reserve of life points
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and your resources will\Nbe completely wiped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.17,0:20:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving you trapped here forever!
